12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_12","text":"What happens then?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_13","text":"You'll be my manager!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_14","text":"And we'll even go on a surface world tour together.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_15","text":"You're jinxing yourself, you know that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_16","text":"LOLOL","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_17","text":"C'mon,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_18","text":"with you around, Commander,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_19","text":"I can jinx it all I want!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_20","text":"Haha, yeah?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_21","text":"Ugh!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_22","text":"I wanna be up on stage","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_23","text":"with Mint and Prika too!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_24","text":"Just hang tight. I'll make it happen once we reclaim the surface.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_25","text":"Funny, didn't someone just call that a jinx?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_26","text":"Lol.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_27","text":"You said it'd be fine as long as I'm here.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_28","text":"Heh, yeah, I guess.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_29","text":"Once we take back the surface,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_30","text":"and Nikkes don't have to","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_31","text":"fight anymore,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_32","text":"guess you'll be out of a job, huh, Commander?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_33","text":"Yeah, probably.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_34","text":"Right, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_35","text":"Then! When you've got nowhere left to go, I'm snatching you up as my manager!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_36","text":"Hmm, not bad.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_37","text":"So promise me that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_38","text":"when you retire, you'll come be my manager.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_39","text":"You think I can do this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_40","text":"Well, yeah!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_41","text":"Your job's to make sure","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_42","text":"the Nikkes fight at their best, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_43","text":"Yeah.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_44","text":"And managers are supposed to","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_45","text":"help pop stars shine too, you know?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_46","text":"Yeah, you're right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_47","text":"They handle schedules,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_48","text":"deal with all the messy contract stuff,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_49","text":"take care of their artist,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_50","text":"and then end up falling for them!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_51","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_51","text":"That last part sounds a bit off.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_52","text":"Haha, anyway,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_53","text":"you'd be amazing as a manager, Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_54","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_54","text":"If you say so, haha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_55","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_55","text":"If you ever make a comeback, I'll be your manager.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_56","text":"Really?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_57","text":"You promised, so no backing out!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_star_03_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_star_03_58","text":"I'm gonna go tell Mint and Prika right now!","jump":null}],"chat":true}